sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Worker (untrusted)
    participant EG as K4 Effect Gateway
    participant PE as K3 Policy Engine
    participant EX as K5 Exposure
    participant TX as Postgres txn
    participant AD as Adapter (creds)
    participant AU as K11 Audit

    W->>EG: propose_intent(action_class, resource_ref, selector, reason_code, rationale)
    EG->>EG: CANONICALISE (step C-prime) — enumerate options,<br/>resolve selector, compute exposure + params + counterparty
    EG->>EG: action_class in closed catalogue? (SR7) else DENY
    EG->>EG: derive idempotency key<br/>H(task‖class‖resource‖param_digest)
    EG->>PE: authority tuple + evidence refs
    PE->>PE: 10-step fail-closed sequence (26 §7)
    PE->>PE: fetch own preconditions — never trust proposal
    Note over PE,TX: steps below are ONE transaction
    PE->>EX: reserve(money, irrecoverable_count)
    EX-->>PE: reserved or INSUFFICIENT_HEADROOM
    PE->>TX: authorisation decision + effect journal row + reservation
    TX-->>EG: committed
    EG->>AU: append (hash-chained)
    alt approval required
      EG->>EG: durable suspend — reservation ALREADY held
    end
    EG->>AD: dispatch(idempotency_key)
    AD-->>EG: outcome
    EG->>TX: outcome + reservation settle/release
    EG->>AU: append outcome
